              "locator": "infobox:13",
              "original_text": "Location: Am Schwarzenberg-Campus 1 (A), Hamburg, 21073, Germany53°27′23.39″N 9°58′5.99″E﻿ / ﻿53.4564972°N 9.9683306°E﻿ / 53.4564972; 9.9683306",
